WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:04.500
Tonight, the God of Universe
and I would like to bless

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:07.800
and release these seven blessings over

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.520
the women in this room
and women worldwide.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.820
First, may

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:20.480
the God of Universe bless you with courage,
bravery and endurance to continue

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:25.460
championing the work that the God
of Universe has placed in your heart to do.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.140
And two,

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.620
may you receive wisdom from above,

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:33.100
from every responsibility
and assignment placed before you.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:37.450
Third, may you be blessed
with divine energy,

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.990
strength and passion to continue pursuing

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:43.850
what has been placed in your heart to do.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:49.670
Four, may you receive discernment
to make the right choices in life

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:54.770
and to recognize what must be
prioritized in each season.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:01:00.350
Fifth, may you break
through in every obstacle

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:04.630
that stands in your way
and may every barrier before

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.490
your destiny be overcome.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:08.630
Sixth,

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:11.650
may you be blessed with strength,

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:16.630
well-being and excellent health
to continue fulfilling your purpose.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:18.270
And seven,

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:20.610
may you be blessed
with a spirit of excellence

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:23.330
in everything that you put your hands to.

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:28.250
From the God of the Universe's heart
and from my heart to every amazing

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:34.650
woman in this room tonight and to the women
across the world: may you rise,

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:38.650
may you break through,
may you fulfill your destiny.

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:40.599
And with the God of the Universe,

00:01:40.639 --> 00:01:43.600
what the God of the Universe
has placed within you,

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:46.340
you become a blessing to the generation.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:47.600
And once again,

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:52.240
when all else fails, try the God
of the Universe in SHEKINAIH SIEW SIN YAP.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.380
It works because it is fully
backed by the power of Heaven.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:58.000
Bang, bang, bang.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.220
Thank you, and God bless everyone.
